Actually, it makes me sick.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:28.720
Screw it.

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:33.160
I quit. I'm going back to normal as of tomorrow.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.950
No way! Haven't I told you?
The girls won't like you unless you act proper.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.410
Are you okay with that?

00:15:40.020 --> 00:15:44.190
But at least I'll have good ol' Kazuki to keep me company.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:46.710
What're childhood friends for, right?

00:15:48.530 --> 00:15:50.990
<i>I didn't think he had that face in him.</i>

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.720
<i>Why am I feeling even more nervous than with I was with the old Yuuji?</i>

00:15:56.180 --> 00:16:01.100
It's just that I don't approve of
 your twisted personality.

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:05.190
In fact, I was hoping you'd fixed it by now.

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:09.570
As you know,
 I hate sloppy and perverted guys-

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.570
Don't be so cold.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.530
Get away!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.620
It seems like nothing happened.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.100
Why are you looking so disappointed?

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:32.720
Hey, Yuuji...

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:33.740
What?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:39.640
Can you come to my classroom after school today?

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.920
They're childhood friends who've always been fighting.

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:48.150
However, they finally realized their true feelings.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:51.110
Inside the classroom, 
as the setting sun shines in...

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:56.140
Enough of your freaky fantasies!

00:16:56.140 --> 00:16:59.950
Suzuhara Chihaya is my best friend.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:03.580
I promised I'd introduce you to her today.

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:08.630
Chihaya-chan? What a nice name!
By all means, "introduce" us!

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:11.780
As a friend.

00:17:11.780 --> 00:17:16.680
You don't have to act cool. 
Just don't act like a perv.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.590
That hurts.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.510
Oh, weren't you the one who wanted him to be all proper?

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.920
I was, but...

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:26.060
He should be fine as long as he doesn't sexually harass her.

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:28.020
That's right! Marie-chan?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:31.190
If Yuuji gets out of control, can you "control" him?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.640
You don't seem to trust my brother.

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:36.580
No... it's just that...

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:41.060
You've made the right choice.
Like you, I also have no faith in him.

00:17:43.180 --> 00:17:49.170
Don't worry. If worse comes to worst, I'll be sure to take him down.

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:54.630
Well, you only have to step in if he tries anything funny.

00:18:05.120 --> 00:18:06.600
Pleased to meet you.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:10.060
I'm Kazuki's childhood friend, Kagura Yuuji.

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.570
Suzuhara Chihaya. Good to meet'cha!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.070
L-Likewise.

00:18:20.770 --> 00:18:23.210
This behavior is still acceptable.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.680
Kazuki and I have known each other
 since middle school.

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:30.410
I've heard a LOT about you, from her.

00:18:30.410 --> 00:18:32.590
C-Chihaya, don't say too much.

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:35.570
Is that so?

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:43.100
I-Is something wrong?

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:49.560
C-Chihaya?

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:53.020
Come on, it's time to bring out your true self!

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:55.840
Release the beast!

00:18:55.840 --> 00:19:00.970
Come on, come on!

00:18:58.310 --> 00:18:59.670
This is...

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:07.080
My brother is not to blame for this, either.

00:19:08.060 --> 00:19:10.620
Is this the real you, Kagura-kun?

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:12.700
Oh, shit!!

00:19:13.040 --> 00:19:15.720
H-How did you know?

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:18.450
Just something I was feeling yesterday.

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:21.220
You weren't your normal self, either.

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.610
There's nothing wrong with acting like
 a handsome, dashing boy.

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:32.360
But me, I prefer this face more.

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:38.940
I don't know why you did it,
but you shouldn't try to be something you're not.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:40.000
Right?

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:50.520
Chihaya-chan, this is the first time 
anyone's ever talked to me like that!

00:19:50.520 --> 00:19:53.370
I was mistaken. Thank you, Chihaya-chan.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.310
Chihaya!

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:58.810
Sorry. I didn't mean to.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:01.910
Don't worry about it!
 It's all good, Kagura-kun.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:06.470
Prepare yourself.

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:10.480
No, Marie-chan. You've got it all wrong!

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:14.130
For once, he's not being a pervert!!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:21.970
Ouch. Why'd you charge in like that?

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:24.290
What's going on?

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:26.120
Sorry.

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.340
Yes!

00:20:37.730 --> 00:20:39.800
That's the way{uh-huh, uh-huh} I like it-!

00:20:48.200 --> 00:20:50.180
Mission accomplished.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.710
Thank you, Marie-chan.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:56.850
I'm his little sister, Marie.
It seems my brother has inconvenienced you.

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.480
You're Kagura-kun's sister?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:03.700
Sorry. That's Yuuji's true nature.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.960
He's a hopeless horndog. 
I can hardly believe this.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:10.850
So this is what you were trying to hide?

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:12.330
Mmm, that's right.

00:21:12.730 --> 00:21:14.490
This is nothing.

00:21:15.230 --> 00:21:19.840
Most boys are like this, anyway.
And a little perversion never hurt anybody.

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.590
You sure are strict, Kazuki.

00:21:23.240 --> 00:21:26.340
That's right, Chihaya-chan! As a boy...

